	<Specimen
		name="The bar's leaves"
		note="Every leaf bound to one store per row, outside a bar. The first row holds the fixture Mix cued and paused; the second has a resolver that rejects, so its status reports the error with the skull. Hover or focus the volume to open its fader. Expand opens the real modal overlay on the first row's store."
		source="packages/player/src/elements/"
